zyn-fusion: ZynAddSubFX is a fully featured open source software synthesizer
zyn-fusion: capable of making a countless number of instruments, like some
zyn-fusion: you would expect from expensive hardware.
zyn-fusion: The synth is polyphonic with additive, subtractive and pad synthesis,
zyn-fusion: waveform generator, effects, filters. layered instrument kits,
zyn-fusion: a virtual keyboard and plugin support. And much more.
zyn-fusion: This is the headless synthesizer (Zyn) with a new UI (Fusion).
